{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:BraidsAndKnots.BraidTwistFlip","@type":"LeanModule","name":"BraidsAndKnots.BraidTwistFlip","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Fin.Basic"],"declarations":9,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.twist_rotation_dihedral","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.twist_rotation_dihedral","kind":"theorem","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/braid-twist-flip.lean#L85-L90","doc":"**Dihedral relation** `σ₁ α σ₁ = α⁻¹` (`= α²`): a reflection inverts the\nrotation. Together with `α³ = id` and `σ₁² = id` this exhibits `D₃ ≅ S₃`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.rotation_ne_id","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.rotation_ne_id","kind":"theorem","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/braid-twist-flip.lean#L79-L83","doc":"`α ≠ id`, so the rotation has order exactly 3 — a genuine 3-cycle of the\nthree branches, not the identity. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.rotation_pow_three","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.rotation_pow_three","kind":"theorem","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/braid-twist-flip.lean#L74-L77","doc":"The rotation has order dividing 3: `α³ = id`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.rotation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.rotation","kind":"def","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/braid-twist-flip.lean#L69-L72","doc":"The **rotation** `α = σ₁σ₂` — the order-3 cyclic permutation of the three\nbranches (the `SU(2)`/`Dic₃` generator `α` of `def:su2-generators`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.twist_flip_braid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.twist_flip_braid","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/braid-twist-flip.lean#L62-L67","doc":"**Braid relation** `σ₁σ₂σ₁ = σ₂σ₁σ₂` — the defining relation of `B₃`, and the\nreason `⟨σ₁,σ₂⟩ ≅ S₃` rather than `V₄` (commuting involutions would fail it). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.flipPerm_involution","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.flipPerm_involution","kind":"theorem","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/braid-twist-flip.lean#L57-L60","doc":"Flip is an involution: `σ₂² = id`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.twistPerm_involution","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.twistPerm_involution","kind":"theorem","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/braid-twist-flip.lean#L52-L55","doc":"Twist is an involution: `σ₁² = id`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.flipPerm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.flipPerm","kind":"def","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/braid-twist-flip.lean#L44-L50","doc":"The flip generator `σ₂` — the reflection `(b₁ b₂)` of the three branches:\n`1 ↔ 2`, with branch `0` fixed. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.twistPerm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.twistPerm","kind":"def","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/braid-twist-flip.lean#L36-L42","doc":"The twist generator `σ₁` — the reflection `(b₀ b₁)` of the three branches:\n`0 ↔ 1`, with branch `2` fixed. ","signatureChunk":0}]}